title Fold P -- confer_slot, and the first fold the arc has taken for free
prompt Autonomous loop -- pick up the running thread, Standfast on reds first, take the next agent-doable lap Lindy-first crux-first on the Microkernel Target double-seat, read one council-rota doc, sweep the prose Radiant, send the increment as its own signed round.
think Standfast first. crux/REDS.md carries 110 rows and every living one reads CLOSED; REDS %110, booked and closed on the last lap, is the newest. No open agent-closable red stands, so the line is free for constructive work.
think The running thread is the Caravan fold arc. Fold O lifted fill_table out of forty-three rungs and its recommend named confer_slot the better crux of the three the queue printed -- forty-three rungs is the widest family standing, and every symbol a fold of it would reach was published that same round.
think Fold O taught that a queue is a lead rather than a verdict, so this lap hashed every confer_slot body before folding it. Forty-five files hold a body by that name; forty-three share one text byte for byte at thirty-nine lines, and 39 x 42 = 1,638 is exactly what the queue printed. The check confirmed rather than corrected, which is still worth the running.
think The two that differ are elders with real reasons. confer.rye owns reserve_arc_at and calls it unqualified, and folding it would ask the module the harness imports to import the harness back -- a cycle. revoke.rye predates the in-flight invariant and states one assert fewer, so folding it would quietly add a check rather than move a body. Both stay home named.
think Then the surprise worth writing down: the fold cost zero widenings. hop_count, reserve_depth, Table, max_in_flight, and the harness import were all already public across all forty-three, because fold O widened exactly those five for fill_table one lap earlier. A fold pays its successors, and the price of a widening is charged once and spent several times.
think Council rota, lap index 1470 mod 27 = 12 -- active-designing/20260618-184912_growing-a-language.md. Its fourth move is diverge by strengthening rather than rewriting, additive and behavior-preserving, each divergence proven by a gate. A fold is that move at the smallest scale: the body does not change, only where it stands, and the choir is the gate that says so.
obs The arithmetic closes with no remainder at all. The family gave back 1,638, the new three-line delegate family carries 3 x 42 = 126, and the carry fell 1,512 -- exactly what the meter measured. Fold O's 47-line gap was eleven family splits its widenings caused; a fold that widens nothing splits nothing, so there is nothing left to explain.
obs The delegate is three lines here against fold O's sixteen, because confer_slot takes two arguments where fill_table takes eleven. A body's carry falls furthest when its signature is short and its interior is long.
obs On disk the same closure holds independently: forty-three rungs each shed thirty-six lines for 1,548, the harness took 75, and 371,654 - 1,473 = 370,181 is what git and wc both report.
